# 🎤 OPIc Question - Day20

## Question

Tell me about a time when you worked hard to achieve something.

---

## Speaking Mission

Speak for 60–90 seconds.

Include:

- What you wanted to achieve
- Why it was important
- What you did
- What difficulties you had
- What the result was
- How you felt

---

## Challenge

Use today's expression:

> As a result,...

Also try to use:

> At first,...

> However,...

> In the end,...

---

## Recommended Structure

I wanted to...

↓

It was important because...

↓

So I...

↓

At first,...

↓

However,...

↓

As a result,...

↓

I felt...
